  "title": "Chicken and Pea Casserole",
  "description": "This quick and easy chicken and pea casserole is a great weeknight meal for your family. It combines canned chunk chicken with condensed mushroom soup, sour cream, peas, Parmesan, pasta, and seasonings.",
  "authors": [
